{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03980","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 崔知贤","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上月河阳地，芳辰景物华。\n緜蛮变时鸟，照曜起春霞。\n柳摇风处色，梅散日前花。\n淹留洛城晚，歌吹石崇家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔知贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}